		<description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana.jpg"><img decoding="async" class="alignleft size-large wp-image-1634" src="https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana-1024x878.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="878" srcset="https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana-1024x878.jpg 1024w, https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana-300x257.jpg 300w, https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana-768x658.jpg 768w, https://beyondpodcasting.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/BeyondPodcasting-20-image-Anthony-Mattana.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a>Allan Tépper converses with Anthony Mattana of Hooke Audio, creator of Hooke Lav, the wireless lavalier microphone which transmits 48 kHz 24-bit audio via bluetooth to your Android, iOS, iPadOS or conventional camcorder while recording a local WAV file just in case. More info at <strong><a href="https://wireless.BeyondPodcasting.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wireless.BeyondPodcasting.com</a></strong>. We also discuss <strong><a href="https://CombinedHosting.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CombinedHosting.com</a></strong> where you can (and should) host your live online radio show or podcast with your own domain (not anybody else’s) and get help with GDPR compliance and DMCA.</p>
<p><em>BeyondPodcasting</em> resides at <span style="color: #0000ff;"><a style="color: #0000ff;" href="http://beyondpodcasting.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BeyondPodcasting.com</a></span><br />
